            %em unistochastic channel
            \&amp;lbrack;
            %a{:href => "#ŻyczkowskiBengtsson04"}> Życzkowski &amp; Bengtsson 2004
            \&amp;rbrack; if it has an
            %a{:href => "quantum+channel#QuantumChannelsAndDecoherence"} environmental representation
            where the environment/bath system
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
